{#
  Borrowing against bitcoin: the lenders — one card per lender, the same
  fields on every card, rendered from src/_data/lenders.json at build time.
  The page script (bitcoin-lenders.js) only adds what needs a live price or a
  reader's input: the trigger-price sentences, the filter chips, the state
  filter and the reader's-own-LTV control. Without JS the cards still carry
  every published figure and the price-free drawdown sentence.
  Design brief: claude/LENDER_LANDSCAPE_DESIGN_2026-09-30 (project);
  SITE_GUIDE "Borrowing against bitcoin: the lenders".
